    "description": "Takamiya Co., Ltd. engages in the development, manufacture, sale, and rental of temporary construction equipment in Japan and internationally. It operates through Platform Business, Sales Business, Rental Business, and Overseas Business segments. It offers OPERA, a platform portal for web orders, delivery vehicle reservations, secondary market systems, and other services. The company is involved in the design, construction, management, and logistics for temporary construction work; general freight forwarding business; creation of provisional design drawings, calculation reports, and architectural equipment drawings, surveying, and various design methods including BIM/CIM modeling, and spatial measurement. It also engages in planning, design, construction, supervision, contracting, and technical guidance for architectural and civil engineering work, as well as scaffolding work; and sale of agricultural construction and agricultural materials. The company was formerly known as SRG Takamiya Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Takamiya Co., Ltd. in April 2019. The company was incorporated in 1969 and is headquartered in Kita, Japan."
